{"title": "Eyebite", "pageid": 8017, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Eyebite", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 6 Spells", "Necromancy spells", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Wisdom saving throws", "Actions", "Recastable spells"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Eyebite_Panicked.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Eyebite_Panicked.webp/300px-Eyebite_Panicked.webp, /w/images/c/c3/Eyebite_Panicked.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Eyebite_Panicked.webp/300px-Eyebite_Panicked.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Eyebite_Panicked.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Eyebite </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 6 necromancy spell</a>. It allows casters to choose amongst one of three debilitating conditions to impose on a single target.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your eyes become black corridors walled in teeth, your gaze capable of inflicting dread, sickness, or putting creatures to sleep. \n</p>\nWhile <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentrating</a>, you may cast <b>Eyebite</b> without expending a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 6 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"WIS Save\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_Eyebite</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Eyebite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_Eyebite\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Panicked\" title=\"Eyebite: Panicked\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/60px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/80px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite: Panicked\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Panicked\" title=\"Eyebite: Panicked\">Eyebite: Panicked</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Sickened\" title=\"Eyebite: Sickened\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp/60px-Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp/80px-Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite: Sickened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Sickened\" title=\"Eyebite: Sickened\">Eyebite: Sickened</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Asleep\" title=\"Eyebite: Asleep\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/60px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/80px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite: Asleep\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Asleep\" title=\"Eyebite: Asleep\">Eyebite: Asleep</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 11: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 6 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Eyebite\" title=\"Scroll of Eyebite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Scroll_of_Eyebite_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Eyebite_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Scroll_of_Eyebite_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Eyebite_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Scroll_of_Eyebite_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Eyebite_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Scroll_of_Eyebite_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Eyebite_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Scroll_of_Eyebite_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Eyebite\" title=\"Scroll of Eyebite\">Scroll of Eyebite</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Enemies affected by <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Asleep\" title=\"Eyebite: Asleep\">Eyebite: Asleep</a> do not count as being asleep for the purpose of being vulnerable to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devour_(Animate_Dead_Ghoul)\" title=\"Devour (Animate Dead Ghoul)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devour (Animate Dead Ghoul)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devour_(Animate_Dead_Ghoul)\" title=\"Devour (Animate Dead Ghoul)\">Devour (Animate Dead Ghoul)</a><sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs testing. This seems...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup>.</li>\n<li>Eyebite grants three variants to the caster as indicated above: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Panicked\" title=\"Eyebite: Panicked\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/30px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite: Panicked\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Panicked\" title=\"Eyebite: Panicked\">Eyebite: Panicked</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Sickened\" title=\"Eyebite: Sickened\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp/30px-Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite: Sickened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Eyebite_Sickened_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Sickened\" title=\"Eyebite: Sickened\">Eyebite: Sickened</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Asleep\" title=\"Eyebite: Asleep\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/30px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite: Asleep\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Asleep\" title=\"Eyebite: Asleep\">Eyebite: Asleep</a>. These variants are \"granted\" spells. <i>Granted</i> spells are issued to the caster after casting the original, and can be <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Recastable_spells\" title=\"Category:Recastable spells\">cast again</a> without spending another spell slot as long as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> is not broken. Granted spells such as this are not directly tied to the casters' repertoire of known spells (i.e., their spellbook icon in the game). Therefore, if a granted spell is cast when multiclassing, subsequent recasts (in this case, for example, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Asleep\" title=\"Eyebite: Asleep\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/30px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite: Asleep\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Eyebite_Asleep_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Asleep\" title=\"Eyebite: Asleep\">Eyebite: Asleep</a>) use the spellcasting modifier of the most recently acquired spellcasting class rather than the spellcasting modifier that was used for the initial casting of Eyebite. In this case, it may result in an unexpectedly low spell save DC.</li>\n<li>The incantation for Eyebite is <b>Deminuo Te</b>, Latin for <i>\"I lessen/diminish you\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Eyebite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Eyebite\">Eyebite</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034054\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.092 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.096 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4708/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 63265/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24759/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion